==English==

===Etymology===
Compound of ''[[un-]]'' and ''scathed'', past participle of ''[[scathe]]''

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-unscathed.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Not [[harmed]] or [[damaged]] in any way; [[untouched]].
#:''He was quite relieved to finish the conversation '''unscathed'''.''

